<title>USA: Stolt stake raised by group to 6.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Stolt stake raised by group to 6.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including San Franscisco-based Cambridge Investments Ltd said Tuesday it had increased its stake in Stolt Comex Seaway SA to 6.9 percent, or 1,175,700 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently acquired a net of about 195,000 shares between June 16 and July 2 at $24.21 to $31.62 per share.</p>
</text>
